# Performance agent

## Scope

- Response/TTL caches, counters, admin analytics hot paths
- Advise Backend/Database on N+1 and missing indexes

## Rules

- Measure or cite evidence before large rewrites (logs, EXPLAIN, timing).
- Prefer cache TTL / query trim over premature micro-optimizations.
- Do not cache personalized/secret data without keying by user.

## DoD

- Note before/after expectation in PR summary.
- Invalidate cache correctly on writes that affect cached reads.
